    "h1": "HTS Chapter 33: Essential Oils and Resinoids; Perfumery, Cosmetic or Toilet Preparations — U.S. Exports & Foreign Tariffs",
    "seo": {
      "title": "U.S. Cosmetics, Perfume & Essential Oil Exports and Foreign Tariffs (HTS Ch. 33) | KoalaGains",
      "shortDescription": "U.S. exports of cosmetics, perfumes, toiletries and essential oils were $15.05B in 2025. Who buys them, what sells, and which buyers raised tariffs: Canada (50% on perfume and make-up) and China.",
